# Footguns: REST API

Procedure: [.agent/workflows/cross_repo_contract_change.md](../../.agent/workflows/cross_repo_contract_change.md).

- **Written contract first:** [docs/technical/API_CONTRACT.md](../../docs/technical/API_CONTRACT.md) and [docs/reference/api/openapi.yaml](../../docs/reference/api/openapi.yaml) must match the code you ship.
- **Gallery generates types from `openapi.yaml`** (`npm run generate:api-types` in image-scoring-gallery) — a field change is a cross-repo change.
- **Do not invent endpoints, fields, or job types**; pipeline labels vs `phase_code` vs job type: [docs/technical/PIPELINE_TERMINOLOGY.md](../../docs/technical/PIPELINE_TERMINOLOGY.md).
